      "date": "2026-07-27 19:08:14.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(6 comments)\n\nExperimental feature testing in progress, please pay attention to the comments\n\nSome concerns, see inline comments. Switching to double quotes does not cover the most common token shape in the in-tree man pages, so on real input this change increases the number of shell errors rather than removing them.",
